## Xcode & User Specific Files
#
# Keep project settings, but ignore user-specific state and layout
build/
DerivedData/
*.pbxuser
!default.pbxuser
*.mode1v3
!default.mode1v3
*.mode2v3
!default.mode2v3
*.perspectivev3
!default.perspectivev3
xcuserdata/

## Xcode 8+ and Workspace State
*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
*.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
*.xcuserdatad/

## Schemes (Uncomment next line if you want to ignore ALL schemes, including shared ones)
# *.xcscheme
# Better practice: Commit shared schemes, ignore personal ones:
*.xcodeproj/xcshareddata/xcschemes/!*.xcscheme

## XCode Playgrounds & Documentation
timeline.xctimeline
playground.xcworkspace

## Swift Package Manager
# SPM build artifacts and resolved versions (check Package.resolved into git for apps, ignore for libraries)
.build/
Packages/
# Package.resolved

## Swiftlint / Tooling caches
.swiftpm/
.swiftlint.cache

## CocoaPods (Uncomment Pods/ if you do NOT commit dependencies)
# Pods/
# Podfile.lock (Commit this for apps, ignore for reusable pods)

## Carthage
# Ignore checkouts/build artifacts (keep Carthage.resolved committed)
Carthage/Build/
Carthage/Checkouts/

## Fastlane
fastlane/report.xml
fastlane/Preview.html
fastlane/screenshots/**/*.png
fastlane/test

